  "caption": "OpenAI just closed the biggest private funding round in history.\n$40 billion. One round. $300 billion valuation.\nTo put this in perspective: that single raise is worth more than most publicly traded tech companies. More than the GDP of over 100 countries.\nThe numbers behind the headline are equally staggering:\n$13B in annualized revenue\n400M weekly active users\nA valuation that surpasses SpaceX and Stripe combined\nWe are watching the fastest wealth creation in private company history, fueled by a technology that barely existed three years ago.\nThe question is no longer whether AI will reshape industries. It is how fast, and who will be left standing when it does.\nSources:\nThe Wall Street Journal \u2014 https://www.wsj.com/tech/ai/openai-funding-round-40-billion-300-billion-valuation\nTechCrunch \u2014 https://techcrunch.com/2025/03/openai-40b-funding\n#OpenAI #AI #VentureCapital #TechFunding #ArtificialIntelligence #Startups #ChatGPT",
